step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Guildmaster Apatura</col> in the <col=800000>Hunter Guild</col>. She told me that <col=800000>Guild Scribe Verity</col> needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in <col=800000>The Burrow</col> below the <col=800000>Guild</col>.</col>
step	2	-	After speaking to Guild Scribe Verity
line	<str>I spoke to Guildmaster Apatura in the Hunter Guild. She told me that Guild Scribe Verity needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in The Burrow below the Guild.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Guild Scribe Verity</col> in <col=800000>The Burrow</col> and learned that she is concerned about the disappearance of <col=800000>Guild Hunter Fox</col>. She suggested I talk to <col=800000>Guild Hunter Wolf</col> to learn more.</col>
step	3	-	After speaking to Guild Hunter Wolf
line	<str>I spoke to Guildmaster Apatura in the Hunter Guild. She told me that Guild Scribe Verity needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in The Burrow below the Guild.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Guild Scribe Verity in The Burrow. She asked to look into the disappearance of Guild Hunter Fox. She suggested I talk to Guild Hunter Wolf to learn more.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Wolf</col> and she explained to me that <col=800000>Fox</col> was looking into making some repairs to <col=800000>Guild Hunter Kiko's Cat Bed</col>. I should have a look at the <col=800000>Bed</col> and see what repairs he was trying to make.</col>
step	4	-	After checking Kiko's bed
line	<str>I spoke to Guildmaster Apatura in the Hunter Guild. She told me that Guild Scribe Verity needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in The Burrow below the Guild.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Guild Scribe Verity in The Burrow. She asked to look into the disappearance of Guild Hunter Fox. She suggested I talk to Guild Hunter Wolf to learn more.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Wolf and she explained to me that Fox was looking into making some repairs to Guild Hunter Kiko's Cat Bed.</str>
line	<col=000080>I distracted <col=800000>Kiko</col> and then inspected his <col=800000>Bed</col> to find some of the fur missing. <col=800000>Fox</col> presumably took a sample to help him find the right replacement. I should speak to <col=800000>Wolf</col> about this.</col>
step	5	-	After finding and talking to Fox
line	<str>I spoke to Guildmaster Apatura in the Hunter Guild. She told me that Guild Scribe Verity needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in The Burrow below the Guild.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Guild Scribe Verity in The Burrow. She asked to look into the disappearance of Guild Hunter Fox. She suggested I talk to Guild Hunter Wolf to learn more.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Wolf and she explained to me that Fox was looking into making some repairs to Guild Hunter Kiko's Cat Bed.</str>
line	<str>I distracted Kiko and then inspected his Bed to find some of the fur missing. Fox presumably took a sample to help him find the right replacement. Wolf suggested I look for him near the Pyre Foxes on the way to the Locus Oasis.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found <col=800000>Fox</col> by a <col=800000>Chasm</col> near the <col=800000>Locus Oasis</col>, but he'd been attacked. He asked me to make a <col=800000>Poultice</col> for him using leaves from two nearby <col=800000>Plants</col> along with an <col=800000>Embertailed Jerboa Tail</col>.</col>
step	6	-	After giving Fox the Poultice
line	<str>I spoke to Guildmaster Apatura in the Hunter Guild. She told me that Guild Scribe Verity needed help with something and asked me to speak to her in The Burrow below the Guild.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Guild Scribe Verity in The Burrow. She asked to look into the disappearance of Guild Hunter Fox. She suggested I talk to Guild Hunter Wolf to learn more.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Wolf and she explained to me that Fox was looking into making some repairs to Guild Hunter Kiko's Cat Bed.</str>
line	<str>I distracted Kiko and then inspected his Bed to find some of the fur missing. Fox presumably took a sample to help him find the right replacement. Wolf suggested I look for him near the Pyre Foxes on the way to the Locus Oasis.</str>
line	<str>I found Fox by a Chasm near the Locus Oasis, but he'd been attacked. He asked me to make a Poultice for him.</str>
line	<str>I created a Poultice for Fox and gave it to him.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Fox</col> explained to me that he was attacked whilst on route to trade with <col=800000>Atza</col> in <col=800000>Outer Fortis</col>. He asked me to go to her on his behalf while he recovers from his injuries. If I give her the <col=800000>Fur Sample</col> that <col=800000>Fox</col> took from <col=800000>Kiko's Bed</col>, she should be able to supply the <col=800000>Fur</col> needed. I can find her home near the south western gate of <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>.</col>
step	7	-	After speaking to Atza
