line	<str>Fox explained to me that he was attacked whilst on route to trade with Atza in Outer Fortis. He asked me to go to her on his behalf while he recovers from his injuries. He gave me the Fur Sample that he took from Kiko's Bed to give to her.</str>
line	<col=000080>I took the <col=800000>Fur Sample</col> to <col=800000>Atza</col> in <col=800000>Outer Fortis</col>. She asked me to assemble some <col=800000>Equipment</col> on her floor while she searched for the right material.</col>
