line	<str>I took the Fur Sample to Atza in Outer Fortis and she gave me the Trimmed Fur needed to fix Kiko's Bed.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to <col=800000>Fox</col> with the <col=800000>Trimmed Fur</col>. He asked me to head back to the <col=800000>Hunter Guild</col> and use the <col=800000>Fur</col> along with an <col=800000>Embertailed Jerboa Tail</col> to fix <col=800000>Kiko's Bed</col>. He also asked me to deliver a <col=800000>Report</col> from him to <col=800000>Guild Scribe Verity</col>.</col>
